Package: strictly
Title: A datasets of results from the BBC's "Strictly Come Dancing"
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Alex", "Homer-Welch", , "me@alexjhomer.co.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:
    This data package provides a collection of datasets collating results from
    the BBC's TV series "Strictly Come Dancing". The main dataset provides
    scores for all performances, with additional lookup tables for supplementary
    information like a breakdown of judges' scores.
